WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:00.868
Hello.

2
00:00:00.868 --> 00:00:05.780
I'm Ansarulhaq Mubarez, a filmmaker, programmer and graphic designer from Kabul.

3
00:00:07.180 --> 00:00:11.050
The logic of code, the magic of cinema, and the art of design.

4
00:00:11.050 --> 00:00:12.610
Three worlds, one vision.

5
00:00:14.010 --> 00:00:20.120
I study audio-visual arts, cinema, at Kabul University, and computer science at Salam University.

6
00:00:21.520 --> 00:00:28.680
I've designed and edited for the AlifBa Educational Center and Academy Baitul Hamd, and made educational and promotional films.

7
00:00:30.080 --> 00:00:37.140
With Premiere Pro, After Effects, DaVinci Resolve, Photoshop and Illustrator, I've made eighty-four graphic designs.

8
00:00:39.130 --> 00:00:41.017
And now I've built CineCode Academy:

9
00:00:41.017 --> 00:00:44.320
free learning, with certificates you can verify with a QR code.

10
00:00:45.720 --> 00:00:51.619
My goal is to bring filmmaking and post-production to an international level, and to tell meaningful stories.

11
00:00:51.619 --> 00:00:51.944
Learn.

12
00:00:51.944 --> 00:00:52.323
Create.

13
00:00:52.323 --> 00:00:52.810
Innovate.
